From 70e33fc39716c408f59718245267e0acee03ee91 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Robert Marko <robert.marko@sartura.hr>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 18:19:18 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] plat: microchip: convert FWU scripts to Python

Convert the JavaScript payload generator and HTML asset inliner used by
the LAN966x and LAN969x firmware-update targets from Ruby to Python.

This removes the Ruby runtime dependency while preserving the generated
FWU artifacts and existing command-line interfaces.

Assisted-by: GPT-5.6
Signed-off-by: Robert Marko <robert.marko@sartura.hr>
---
